    "summary": "Use it in your [Shooting phase](vsdata:core-rule/shooting-phase) or in either player's [Fight phase](vsdata:core-rule/fight-phase) on 1 **INQUISITOR**, **INQUISITORIAL AGENTS** or **ORDO MALLEUS** unit of yours.\n\nPick 1 enemy **DAEMON** unit **visible** to the chosen unit and within 12\" of it; that enemy unit takes a Battle-shock test. On a failed test, for the rest of the phase, attacks by your **AGENTS OF THE IMPERIUM** units against it have **[[DEVASTATING WOUNDS]](vsdata:weapon-ability/devastating-wounds)**.",
